Subject: [PATCH] Keep client reports and association work on their radio state

Late associated metrics and client capability reports must update data without
resetting an unrelated candidate, steering or policy command. Protect the
state transition with the existing command lock and its expected pending state.

Each agent data model includes all its radios. A BSSID match alone therefore
reserved every radio of that agent for one client association; only the
matching source AL and BSS RUID may be admitted. Keep the existing no-link
MLD fallback for records without a per-link BSS match.

Upstream-Status: Pending

